    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "We are delighted to present  this turnkey, detached  5-bedroom, 4 bathroom house for sale.  This is a rare opportunity to acquire an exceptional furnished residence presented in excellent condition and ready for immediate occupation as a large family home or for the savy investor seeking a high rental return.  The property is located on an extra-large corner site in south-facing landscaped gardens which are not overlooked.  The site also lends itself to the opportunity to extend or accommodate a separate living unit under the new planning rules currently announced by the Government.  \r\nIdeally located in a much-sought after mature area which is only minutes from Mayo University Hospital, ATU campus and Vantive Pharmaceuticals and 15 minute drive to Abbvie, Westport.\r\n\r\nThe accommodation begins with an inviting entrance hall which sets the tone for the interior throughout.  Leading off to the right is the living-room with marble fireplace incorporating a gas fire creating a warm and welcoming glow. To the rear, the home opens up to an open-plan kitchen and dining area and separate spacious utility room with additional storage space.  Sliding door gives access to rear patios and gardens. On the ground floor  is a large, double en-suite bedroom with electric shower and generous built-in wardrobes.  Two further bedrooms with the option of using one room as an office.  A tiled family bathroom. Completing the ground floor space is under-stairs storage and a separate cupboard.  \r\nUpstairs, there are two well-proportioned bedrooms, one with new en-suite bathroom. The other bedroom has an adjacent, private bathroom with electric shower.  Both bedrooms have ample storage and wardrobe space.  \r\n\r\nExternally, the property provides two parking spaces with well-maintained front gardens.  To the rear, the landscaped garden offers a peaceful and private oasis with established shrubs and trees and two patio areas to enjoy in the south-facing gardens; designed for both relaxation and functionality.  A garden shed is located at the side for additional storage space for bicycles and outdoor equipment."
      },
      {
