        "Content": "•\tTotal area 155 sq m  with large corner site\r\n•\t5 bedroom, 4 bathrooms\r\n•\tFully insulated walls & attic.  BER C2\r\n•\tExcellent condition throughout; sale can include furniture\r\n•\tWithin easy reach of MUH, ATU Mayo, Vantive, Lough Lannagh & 15 mins drive to Abbvie in Westport\r\n•\tPrivate rear landscaped gardens with established trees, shrubs and two patio areas."
